    "© 2026 Orhan Akyol - wHiTeWaY studio<br><br>📧 Support: <a href=\"mailto:moleculoxsupport@gmail.com\" style=\"color:#9d7bff\">moleculoxsupport@gmail.com<\/a><br>✉️ Contact: <a href=\"mailto:oakyol82@hotmail.com\" style=\"color:#9d7bff\">oakyol82@hotmail.com<\/a><br>📸 Instagram: <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/whitewayw/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#9d7bff\">@wHiTeWaYw<\/a><br>🎮 Official Web Page: <a href=\"https://whitewayhan.itch.io/moleculox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#9d7bff\">whitewayhan.itch.io/moleculox<\/a><br>🌐 Direct Web: <a href=\"https://moleculox.netlify.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#9d7bff\">moleculox.netlify.app<\/a>": "© 2026年奥尔汉·阿基奥尔 - wHiTeWaY工作室<br><br>📧 支持: <a href=\"mailto:moleculoxsupport@gmail.com\" style=\"color:#9d7bff\">moleculoxsupport@gmail.com<\/a><br>✉️ 联系人: <a href=\"mailto:oakyol82@hotmail.com\" style=\"color:#9d7bff\">oakyol82@hotmail.com<\/a><br>📸 互联网 <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/whitewayw/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#9d7bff\">@wHiTeWaYw<\/a><br>🎮 官方网站: <a href=\"https://whitewayhan.itch.io/moleculox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#9d7bff\">whitewayhan.itch.io/moleculox<\/a><br>🌐 直接网络: <a href=\"https://moleculox.netlify.app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color:#9d7bff\">moleculox.netlify.app<\/a>",
    "↪️ One-way tile": "↪️ 单向",
    "+ NEW PLAYER": "+ 新的玩家",
    "+20 MoleCoin bonus": "+20 MoleCoin奖金",
    "+5 MoleCoin bonus": "+5 MoleCoin奖金",
    "<div class=\"guideIntro\"><b>⚛️ Push atoms, build molecules, save science!<\/b><span>Tap an atom and choose a direction. It slides until an obstacle.<\/span><\/div><section class=\"guideSection\"><h4>🎯 CORE GOAL<\/h4><ul><li>Build the 2D molecule layout shown on the GOAL card.<\/li><li>Finish at or below PAR to earn 3 stars.<\/li><li>Undo and Restart do not erase campaign progress.<\/li><\/ul><\/section><section class=\"guideSection\"><h4>🧪 SPECIAL MECHANICS<\/h4><ul><li>❄️ Frozen atoms stay put; 🔥 Fire melts ice.<\/li><li>⚡ Electricity travels through connected groups.<\/li><li>🍯 Sticky atoms move together after bonding.<\/li><li>Portal A/B transports atoms; switches open doors; lasers reward safe timing.<\/li><\/ul><\/section><section class=\"guideSection\"><h4>🏆 PROGRESSION<\/h4><ul><li>301 main experiments, Bonus Lab, Daily Experiment, and Atom Duel are available.<\/li><li>Moleculopedia stores discovered molecule and element information.<\/li><li>Link a permanent account to protect progress across devices.<\/li><\/ul><\/section>": "<div class=\"guideIntro\"><b>⚛️ 推动原子，构建分子，拯救科学！<\/b><span>点击一个原子并选择方向。它会一直滑动，直到遇到障碍物。<\/span><\/div><section class=\"guideSection\"><h4>🎯 核心目标<\/h4><ul><li>还原“目标”卡片所示的2D分子布局。<\/li><li>在PAR步数以内完成即可获得3星。<\/li><li>撤销和重新开始不会清除你的战役进度。<\/li><\/ul><\/section><section class=\"guideSection\"><h4>🧪 特殊机制<\/h4><ul><li>❄️ 冻结原子无法移动；🔥 火焰可以融化冰。<\/li><li>⚡ 电流会沿相连的原子群传播。<\/li><li>🍯 黏性原子成键后会一起移动。<\/li><li>A/B传送门可以传送原子；开关会开启门；激光需要把握安全时机。<\/li><\/ul><\/section><section class=\"guideSection\"><h4>🏆 游戏进程<\/h4><ul><li>游戏包含301个主实验、奖励实验室、每日实验和原子对决。<\/li><li>分子百科会保存已发现的分子与元素信息。<\/li><li>绑定永久账户，可在不同设备间保护你的进度。<\/li><\/ul><\/section>",
    "<section class=\"release latest\"><h4>R46 — Release<\/h4><ul><li>Fixed a rare portal-core animation rendering error.<\/li><li>Hardened result-screen button layout across phone sizes.<\/li><li>Added player-name filtering, reporting, and on-device blocking to public rankings.<\/li><li>Prepared native Android/iOS attestation and store-facing account text.<\/li><\/ul><\/section>": "<section class=\"release latest\"><h4>R46 释放<\/h4><ul><li>修复了一个罕见的门户核心动画染错误.<\/li><li>在电话尺寸上加固的结果屏幕按布局.<\/li><li>在公众排名中添加了玩家名字过,报告和设备上的封锁.<\/li><li>编制原生Android/iOS证书和面向商店的帐户文本.<\/li><\/ul><\/section>",
