    "down": "下面",
    "DOWN": "下面",
    "Dr. E admitted that he had prepared the Nobel file not to win a prize, but to document and repair the mistake he and Dr. Null had made together years ago. Dr. Null agreed that the responsibility belonged to both of them.": "Dr. E承认他准备了诺贝尔文件, 不是为了赢得奖项, Null博士同意责任属于他们俩.",
    "Dr. E aligned atoms along the field lines. Every correct bond opened the island’s central gate a little farther.": "Dr. E 在场线上排列原子. 每个正确的纽带打开了岛屿的中心门.",
    "Dr. E and Dr. Null faced the mistake they had hidden for years.": "Dr. E和Null博士面临了他们多年来隐藏的错误.",
    "Dr. E and Dr. Null have seen this signature before.": "Dr. E和Null博士以前见过这个签名.",
    "Dr. E did not stop the experiment; he wanted to see the truth.": "Dr. E没有阻止实验;他想知道真相.",
    "Dr. E entered the new lab. He held the key card backwards, yet the door still opened.": "Dr. E进入了新的实验室. 他拿着钥匙卡倒退,但门仍然打开.",
    "Dr. E is certain he is the world’s greatest scientist. The Nobel jury is not there yet.": "Dr. E 他是世界上最伟大的科学家. 诺贝尔陪审团还没有到来.",
    "Dr. E practised his signature. The award had not arrived, but the pen was ready.": "Dr. E练习他的签名. 奖金还没有到达,但笔已经准备好了.",
    "Dr. E prepared Experiment 50 to observe the X-Bond inside a stable molecule.": "Dr. E 准备了实验50来观察一个稳定的分子内部的X-Bond.",
    "Dr. E put on his glasses when three mechanics appeared. The lenses were fake.": "Dr. E 当三名机械师出现时,他戴了眼镜. 这些镜头是假的.",
    "Dr. E scanned the crystals. Frozen molecular memories were trapped inside.": "Dr. E扫描了晶体. 冰冷的分子记忆被困在里面.",
    "Dr. E shook his head and started Experiment 50. At the same moment, the cat’s fur stood on end and its atom pendant flashed with the reactor.": "Dr. E摇了头,开始了50号实验. 在同一时刻,猫的皮站在端上,它的原子吊闪着反应堆.",
    "Dr. E shook his head and started Experiment 50. At the same moment, the cat’s fur stood on end and its atom pendant flashed with the reactor. “Or we learn the truth.”": "Dr. E摇了头,开始了50号实验. 在同一时刻,猫的皮站在端上,它的原子吊闪着反应堆. 或者我们学会了真相.",
    "Dr. E Tip": "Dr. E 提示",
    "Dr. E tongue reaction": "Dr. E舌头反应",
    "Dr. E: First, look here — GOAL shows the molecule you must build.": "Dr. E:首先,看这里 目标显示你必须构建的分子.",
    "DR. E'S EQUIPMENT SHOP": "医生 电子设备商店",
    "DR. E'S LAB": "医生 我们的实验室",
    "DR. E's RING": "医生 这就是E的戒指",
    "Dr. Null appeared at the door.": "Null博士出现在门口.",
    "Dr. Null appeared at the door. “I did not take it, E. There is no normal tear along the edge; the X-Bond seems to have pulled the page out. We need to find where it went.”": "Null博士出现在门口. 我没有接受,E. 在边缘上没有正常的撕裂;X-Bond似乎拉了页面. 我们需要找到它去哪里.",
    "Dr. Null compared the readings.": "Null博士比较了这些数据.",
    "Dr. Null compared the readings. “This is not sabotage. The signal latched onto the X-Bond in the formula, carried the page somewhere, and is now learning how bonds form.”": "Null博士比较了这些数据. 这不是破坏. 信号锁在公式中的X-Bond上,把页面带到某个地方,现在正在学习如何形成链接.",
    "Dr. Null designed controlled heat pulses.": "Null博士设计了控制热脉冲.",
    "Dr. Null designed controlled heat pulses. “Do not use force. Heat the right atom at the right moment.”": "Null博士设计了控制热脉冲. 不要使用武力. 在正确的时刻加热正确的原子.",
    "Dr. Null entered the final experiment number. Dr. E placed his hand on the console and turned to the player.": "Null博士输入了最后的实验号码. Dr. E把手放在控制台上,转向了播放器.",
    "Dr. Null entered the final experiment number. Dr. E placed his hand on the console and turned to the player. “You will form the final bond.”": "Null博士输入了最后的实验号码. Dr. E把手放在控制台上,转向了播放器. 你将形成最后的纽带.",
    "Dr. Null kept the safe route visible for the cat while Dr. E held the energy steady for a few more seconds.": "Null博士让猫看到安全路线, Dr. E 保持能量稳定几秒钟.",
    "Dr. Null kept the safe route visible for the cat while Dr. E held the energy steady for a few more seconds. “The red button. Come on, little partner.”": "Null博士让猫看到安全路线, Dr. E 保持能量稳定几秒钟. 红色按. 快吧,小伙伴.",
    "Dr. Null locked the portal phase onto the X Signal. The exit would open only at the correct moment.": "Null博士把门户阶段锁定在X信号上. 只有在正确的时刻才会打开出口.",
    "Dr. Null locked the portal phase onto the X Signal. The exit would open only at the correct moment. “Do not activate the red control until I say so.”": "Null博士把门户阶段锁定在X信号上. 只有在正确的时刻才会打开出口. 直到我说的话,不要激活红色控制器.",
    "Dr. Null pointed at the display. Resonance was crossing the safe limit, but Dr. E stayed at the console.": "Null博士指着显示器. 响应超过了安全极限,但Dr. E留在控制台上.",
    "Dr. Null pointed at the display. Resonance was crossing the safe limit, but Dr. E stayed at the console. “Resonance is rising. We can stop this experiment.”": "Null博士指着显示器. 响应超过了安全极限,但Dr. E留在控制台上. 共振正在上升. 我们可以停止这个实验.",
    "Dr. Null rebuilt the portal engine into a system capable of an orbital jump.": "Null博士重新构建了门口发动机成为一个能够飞行轨道的系统.",
    "Dr. Null rebuilt the portal engine into a system capable of an orbital jump. “This time I know the target one hundred percent. Approximately.”": "Null博士重新构建了门口发动机成为一个能够飞行轨道的系统. 这次我知道目标百分之百. 大约.",
