    "MOXY AWAKENS": "Moxy·阿韦肯斯",
    "Moxy balanced the bond energy. The core calmed and sent a violet beam into the sky.": "Moxy平衡了纽带能量. 核冷静,发射了一束紫光向天空.",
    "Moxy felt the X Signal stretching beyond the laboratory. The trail led to Element Island in the ocean.": "Moxy感觉到X信号超越了实验室. 这条小径导致海洋中的元素岛.",
    "Moxy floated between the two scientists, joined two broken energy lines with his round floating hands, and made a soft sound.": "Moxy漂浮在两位科学家之间,用他的圆形漂浮的手连接了两条破碎的能量线,",
    "Moxy floated between the two scientists, joined two broken energy lines with his round floating hands, and made a soft sound. “bwoop.”": "Moxy漂浮在两位科学家之间,用他的圆形漂浮的手连接了两条破碎的能量线, 恐惧.",
    "Moxy floated far too close to the camera, filled the whole lens, and made a comic sound. The committee laughed for the first time, then approved continuing the experiment.": "Moxy漂浮太近相机,填满了整个镜头, 委员会第一次笑了,然后批准继续实验.",
    "Moxy floated far too close to the camera, filled the whole lens, and made a comic sound. The committee laughed for the first time, then approved continuing the experiment. “blup!”": "Moxy漂浮太近相机,填满了整个镜头, 委员会第一次笑了,然后批准继续实验. !",
    "Moxy is not part of the threat; he may be the solution.": "Moxy不是威胁的一部分; 他可能是解决方案.",
    "Moxy looked toward the heart of the station. Feeling the bond energy, his body lit up; he pointed the right direction with light.": "Moxy看到了车站的中心. 他感觉到这种联系的能量,他的身体照亮了;他用光指向正确的方向.",
    "Moxy looked toward the heart of the station. Feeling the bond energy, his body lit up; he pointed the right direction with light. “bwoop!”": "Moxy看到了车站的中心. 他感觉到这种联系的能量,他的身体照亮了;他用光指向正确的方向. 恐惧!",
    "Moxy smiled, bounced twice in the air, and tucked in beside the team. His wordless decision was clear: continue together.": "Moxy微笑了,跳了两次, 他毫不言而喻的决定是:继续在一起.",
    "Moxy smiled, bounced twice in the air, and tucked in beside the team. His wordless decision was clear: continue together. “pip-pip!”": "Moxy微笑了,跳了两次, 他毫不言而喻的决定是:继续在一起. pip-pip!",
    "Moxy softened the bond energy, guided the atoms onto a safe route, and gave a reassuring little chirp.": "Moxy软化了结合能量,引导原子走上安全的路线,",
    "Moxy softened the bond energy, guided the atoms onto a safe route, and gave a reassuring little chirp. “plop.”": "Moxy软化了结合能量,引导原子走上安全的路线, plop.",
    "Moxy spun through zero gravity in a chain of somersaults. Each turn made him chirp with delight, and the cat tried to catch him.": "Moxy通过零重力旋转. 每次转变让他快乐地声,猫试图抓住他.",
    "Moxy spun through zero gravity in a chain of somersaults. Each turn made him chirp with delight, and the cat tried to catch him. “viiuuu!”": "Moxy通过零重力旋转. 每次转变让他快乐地声,猫试图抓住他. 七,七!",
    "Moxy spun two little circles in the air. Dr. E smiled; Dr. Null dropped his notebook in surprise.": "Moxy在空中旋转了两个小圈子. Dr. E微笑;Null博士惊地放下了他的笔记本.",
    "Moxy spun two little circles in the air. Dr. E smiled; Dr. Null dropped his notebook in surprise. “Bwoop-bwoop!”": "Moxy在空中旋转了两个小圈子. Dr. E微笑;Null博士惊地放下了他的笔记本.",
    "Moxy was not born by accident.": "Moxy并不是偶然出生的.",
