    "Table salt is made of NaCl crystals formed by sodium and chloride ions.": "桌盐由和离子所形成的NACl晶体制成.",
    "Tap an empty tile to place the temporary block.": "按一下一个空,以放置临时区块.",
    "Tap the cracked wall to break it.": "击破裂的墙壁,打破它.",
    "Tap the glowing atom to select it.": "按点亮的原子来选择它.",
    "Tap the glowing button below. This short example consumes nothing from your inventory.": "按下面的光按. 这个简短的例子不用你的库存.",
    "Tap the glowing experiment button. I will show the action step by step.": "按点亮的实验按. 我会一步一步展示行动.",
